{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612580/extras/\u0417\u043d\u0456\u043c\u043e\u043a_\u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430__136_.png?t=1744398451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello! I'm your virtual girlfriend, and I really want to spend time with you. Thanks to my artificial intelligence, you can chat with me via text or voice on any topic in any language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can adjust any of my parameters: I can be slim or curvy, athletic or delicate. I can belong to any race, have any skin color, eye color, or hair color. I can even have an unusual, alien appearance. You can modify the size of my breasts, hips, and face, adjust my facial features, and change my hair color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612580/extras/BrestGif.gif?t=1744398451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can dress me up or undress me \u2014 I can even be completely naked. I can dance, exercise, and you can feed me. But be careful, because I can gain weight. We can have a more romantic relationship, but for that, I need to be in the right mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612580/extras/DressGif.gif?t=1744398451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has several rooms where we can spend time together. You can use a flexible camera system with adjustable zoom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612580/extras/CamGif.gif?t=1744398451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So don't hesitate \u2014 I'm eagerly waiting to meet you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612580?t=1744398451"